{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"For a stable flow through a section, the volumetric flow Q is equal to the cross-sectional area A multiplied by the average velocity v: Q = A × v. To estimate the filling time, divide the volume of the container by the flow. The actual system will change with changes in pressure, friction, fittings, fluid characteristics and liquid levels.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"flow-rate-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"flow-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["flow-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"zh-CN","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"对于通过一个部分的稳定流动,体积流量Q等于横截面积A乘以平均速度v:Q = A × v。 要估计填充时间,将容器体积除以流量。 实际系统会随着压力、摩擦、配件、流体特性和液位变化而变化。","record_id":"de3c7a5fb37471dd5f807c3441d02cfaf4111e73faa7a6ab0f0d2a519591f5af","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.4353490378749996,"source":"For steady flow through a section, volumetric flow rate Q equals cross-sectional area A multiplied by average velocity v: Q = A × v. To estimate filling time, divide container volume by flow rate. Real systems can vary with pressure, friction, fittings, fluid properties and changing levels.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"1f3f4899f63ab5cc3e1f65d9265252070b9fa68d439aaa24dc4a03795f9b489f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"对于通过一个部分的稳定流动,体积流量Q等于横截面积A乘以平均速度v:Q = A × v。 要估计填充时间,将容器体积除以流量。 实际系统会随着压力、摩擦、配件、流体特性和液位变化而变化。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
